\r\n  There will always be honor to guard, my boy;\r\n    There will always be hills to climb,\r\n  And tasks to do, and battles new\r\n    From now till the end of time.\r\n\r\n  There will always be dangers to face, my boy;\r\n    There will always be goals to take;\r\n  Men shall be tried, when the roads divide,\r\n    And proved by the choice they make.\r\n  There will always be burdens to bear, my boy;\r\n    There will always be need to pray;\r\n  There will always be tears through the future years,\r\n    As loved ones are borne away.\r\n\r\n  There will always be God to serve, my boy,\r\n    And always the Flag above;\r\n  They shall call to you until life is through\r\n    For courage and strength and love.\r\n  So these are things that I dream, my boy,\r\n    And have dreamed since your life began:\r\n  That whatever befalls, when the old world calls,\r\n    It shall find you a sturdy man.\r\n\r\n\r\n_Edgar A. Guest._\r\n\r\nFrom \"The", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 78081, "end_char_idx": 79011, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "199aad36-b702-4c66-9b45-a229517d1cc0", "embedding": [0.04958754, 0.016751887, -0.011042758, 0.021526383, -0.004321557, 0.040650964, 0.024971275, 0.0782103, 0.020152569, 0.009105838, -0.0048000137, 0.023468532, 0.10026392, 0.00077289017, -0.023314979, -0.029304912, 0.037101425, -0.031114297, -0.024347387, 0.013783766, 0.0137616005, -0.0304683, 0.008063296, -0.026643224, -0.058646757, -0.002080041, 0.04478737, -0.022112383, -0.022602264, -0.00322658, 0.032186776, 0.04815907, 0.012989901, -0.018548915, 0.035026874, 0.008456996, -0.05006009, -0.034616213, 0.031260844, -0.079867296, -0.066117674, 0.015946131, -0.036913376, 0.011496066, -0.04644722, -0.004077685, -0.028386746, 0.017234765, -0.019928828, 0.057618193, 0.040687963, 0.055065148, 0.008172635, 0.03711202, 0.018590074