g singers!\r\n  Hail to the brave light-bringers!\r\n  Forward I reach and share\r\n  All that they sing and dare.\r\n\r\n  The airs of heaven blow o'er me;\r\n  A glory shines before me\r\n  Of what mankind shall be,--\r\n  Pure, generous, brave, and free.\r\n\r\n  A dream of man and woman\r\n  Diviner but still human,\r\n  Solving the riddle old,\r\n  Shaping the Age of Gold!\r\n\r\n  The love of God and neighbor;\r\n  An equal-handed labor;\r\n  The richer life, where", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 146825, "end_char_idx": 147755, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "1ef838b2-31c4-4ffa-abe4-ceb663a4c3f8", "embedding": [0.0024597142, 0.03840684, -0.009032526, 0.030284343, 0.0022806688, 0.049150407, 0.0065667997, 0.042815212, 0.039443534, 0.057027254, -0.023903415, -0.06940147, 0.04176135, 0.062004615, 0.022475125, -0.042253044, -0.0022946016, 0.030966407, -0.08426851, 0.020723578, 0.042342503, -0.015270426, -0.006513424, -0.027354402, 0.0011541825, -0.006664041, -0.01544561, -0.045390368, 0.021960888, -0.0137667125, 0.04075111, 0.024070045, 0.056950506, -0.06366282, 0.044942174, -0.0048921434, -0.032838836, 0.0017748215, 0.023051674, -0.033714205, -0.0539477, -0.005144603, -0.011840214, 0.046860103, -0.023316097, -0.08262599, -0.00030273138, -0.015450804, -0.01013079, 0.07012197, 0.07200906, 0.022234391, -0.052670933, 0.07359894, -0.03230112, -0.039088503, -0.052409794, -0.038925685, 0.024342084, 0.02190128, 0.015361272, 0.027597524, -0.025051473, -0.005548291, 0.02733366, 0.032398924, -0.05857979, 0.023078525, -0.03973251, 0.0027572995, -0.006653971, 0.010218591, -0.062725544, 0.021187134, 0.026710466, 0.0046257703, 0.0004914361, -0.069106944, -0.039273, 0.06918519, -0.032271873, 0.019217158, 0.093863636, 0.04662, 0.013526356, -0.0012431429, -0.031641547, -0.021841548, -0.06088406, -0.00041783907, 0.0508108