n\r\n  My heart leaps up when I behold\r\n  A rainbow in the sky:\r\n  So was it when my life began;\r\n  So is it now I am a man;\r\n  So be it when I shall grow old,\r\n    Or let me die!\r\n  The Child is father of the Man;\r\n  And I could wish my days to be\r\n  Bound each to each by natural piety.\r\n\r\n\r\n_William Wordsworth._\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTHE FIRM OF GRIN AND BARRETT\r\n\r\n\r\nIt has been said that when disaster overtakes us, we can do one of two\r\nthings--we can grin and bear it, or we needn't", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 184786, "end_char_idx": 185697, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "6ab3b9b0-1b98-408d-8e60-e7276e7735b2", "embedding": [0.04999786, 0.013390057, -0.000230635, 0.03029079, -0.0017018754, 0.027413819, 0.048381183, 0.029816944, 0.015098823, 0.029018676, 0.029837865, 0.056019586, 0.05313557, 0.050979078, 0.051497355, -0.05542523, 0.0004148933, 0.017309193, -0.059719536, 0.0027046755, 0.00074032805, -0.044955216, -0.019399561, -0.04179637, -0.038648505, -0.044467594, 0.0061929915, -0.026136622, 0.0046586376, -0.04362201, 0.015400743, 0.019191585, 0.017556073, 0.004472619, 0.025988149, 0.024968114, -0.045010068, 0.0077767596, -0.0028569386, -0.009816726, -0.046870913, 0.06991969, -0.0051455186, 0.033125672, 0.012267675, -0.03761426, -0.030665504, 0.02275022, -0.027163606, 0.046019915, 0.0110884085, 0.031065214, -0.01786551, 0.046676572, 0.00926568, -0.010642038, -0.0067639807, -0.03701484, 0.03477665, 0.009205827, 0.038076844, 0.002744771, 0.046501085, 0.018555187, 0.068174556, -0.032591272, -0.0106891, -0.008661582, -0.016636223, 0.045847613, -0.015095165, 0.0014555748, -0.0054343725, 0.02936083, 0.03285356, -0.041857604, 0.036426123, -0.07683665, 0.02120649, 0.01689648, -0.03884702, -0.0023055747, 0.09024792, 0.034882307, 0.021880643, -0.008715136, -0.0035007664, -0.086531