\n  Men may mock and fame deride you,\r\n  But you'll mind them not a whit\r\n  If you laugh a little bit.\r\n\r\n\r\n_Edmund Vance Cooke._\r\n\r\nFrom \"A Patch of Pansies.\"\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nA SONG OF LIFE\r\n\r\n\r\nMany of us merely exist, and think that we live. What we should regain\r\nat all costs is freshness and intensity of being. This need not involve\r\nturbulent activity. It may involve quite the opposite.\r\n\r\n\r\n  Say not, \"I live!\"\r\n    Unless the morning's trumpet brings\r\n  A shock of glory to your soul,\r\n    Unless the ecstasy that sings\r\n  Through rushing worlds and insects' wings,\r\n    Sends you upspringing to your goal,\r\n  Glad of the need for toil and strife,\r\n    Eager to grapple hands with Life--\r\n  Say not, \"I live!\"\r\n\r\n  Say not, \"I live!\"\r\n    Unless the energy that rings", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 209084, "end_char_idx": 209994, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "8dad20b1-72dc-4b90-9d90-5644794abeca", "embedding": [0.032377645, 0.025866192, -0.022065891, 0.009792148, 0.009847975, 0.0058773803, 0.059334572, 0.032148562, 0.014083462, 0.063403256, -0.0093337735, 0.0066528753, 0.11124242, 0.029727342, 0.048162457, -0.0640412, -0.012957203, -0.044433746, -0.03906283, 0.0023654879, 0.01613364, -0.024973521, -0.0061566555, -0.012875992, -0.022958219, -0.021310812, 0.02143242, -0.022825243, 0.012357422, -0.038925447, 0.031476498, 0.014603255, 0.021816924, 0.012844588, -0.004306909, 0.020501647, -0.045022473, -0.0030470311, -0.00233853, -0.04575339, -0.041180205, 0.032257717, -0.032314483, 0.03905165, 0.015436877, -0.05385821, -0.005745988, -0.04920404, -0.0149371885, 0.078879796, 0.074178524, 0.030185958, -0.04649342, 0.007200639, -0.020616237, -0.024456266, -0.020181455, -0.023863332, 0.015142164, -0.0063337204, 0.037771106, -0.0016255439, -0.0269485