rrible Foe, thou hast lied!\r\n  Here with my battle before me,\r\n  God of the fighting Clan,\r\n  Grant that the woman who bore me\r\n  Suffered to suckle a Man!\r\n\r\n\r\n_John", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 225765, "end_char_idx": 226637, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "70ba4e07-6cfe-411c-a59b-cd947c55ea28", "embedding": [-0.028172232, 0.041191157, 0.01522254, -0.0023095564, -0.02485056, 0.01389273, 0.0124217365, 0.05178923, 0.0059255036, -0.011370278, 0.011591718, 0.0079455245, 0.060465176, 0.011965178, 0.08351903, -0.04324312, -0.031465616, 0.0023654616, -0.07508613, 0.010325571, 0.03830025, -0.009731232, -0.010187282, 0.0023440912, -0.058330942, 0.03418235, -0.0008148549, -0.053985152, 0.0014393388, -0.004729689, 0.0048756427, 0.010645313, 0.020682862, 0.0020060996, 0.08922671, 0.005631234, -0.05166842, 0.004957881, 0.027356688, -0.06594654, -0.060131744, 0.059274368, -0.003344088, 0.03109662, 0.01095565, -0.01798063, 0.034308597, -0.014654275, 0.012137953, 0.060948458, 0.058845222, 0.006874878, -0.039797556, 0.036528155, -0.036071062, -0.048477113, -0.0095238285, -0.015470997, 0.033921536, 0.02306156, 0.0062729376, 0.0072628106, -0.02284968, -0.00016942788, -0.024299923, 0.033191826, 0.006799527, 0.00401431, -0.010994484, 0.010205657, -0.041859712, 0.01964537, -0.046182856, 0.013861869, 0.010096304, -0.013747419, -0.021675844, -0.017309092, -0.017672068, 0.02765351, -0.032577034, -0.019920215, 0.065102495, 0.0832853, 0.019644344, 0.033856515, -0.04454434, -0.0255168, -0.071862414, -0.016247572, 0.06748856, 0.04353932, -0.027828857, 0.0073762056, 0.06569322, -0.019335287, -0.07134205, -0.026206885, -0.00027904855, 0.08004201, 0.049219582, 0.013152158, 0.00013858432, -0.089212045, 0.0306275, 0.0338402, 0.010323581, -0.03258543, -0.028968899, -0.07238783, 0.021455782, -0.1088198, 0.006465675, -0.04