n    Thou who art victory and law\r\n    When empty terrors overawe;\r\n    From vain temptations dost set free,\r\n  And calm'st the weary strife of frail humanity!\r\n\r\n    There are who ask not if thine eye\r\n    Be on them; who, in love and truth\r\n    Where no misgiving is, rely\r\n    Upon the genial sense of youth:\r\n    Glad hearts! without reproach or blot,\r\n    Who do thy work, and know it not:\r\n    Oh! if through confidence misplaced\r\n  They fail, thy", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 282890, "end_char_idx": 283737, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "6c448a29-ef08-4008-9c72-836bec853e4d", "embedding": [0.01911381, 0.049851842, -0.025427325, 0.027757151, 0.013952038, 0.03452018, 0.024959821, 0.048647754, 0.01291234, 0.055078853, -0.008372994, 0.0049832496, 0.053657316, 0.05176297, 0.04167292, -0.051026206, -0.008293549, 0.016947908, -0.049587343, 0.0504243, 0.024824562, 0.005695821, 0.0046475385, -0.033325564, -0.011308836, -0.04210706, 0.049021006, -0.055456102, 0.021200774, -0.05021132, 0.0210754, 0.008996719, 0.03522222, -0.05599136, 0.044670377, -0.021515712, -0.026153041, 0.024654984, 0.024735264, -0.056567155, -0.09744457, -0.015923044, 0.007591501, 0.029288538, -0.026469195, -0.041235004, -0.02151165, 0.003964098, -0.032251444, 0.057230998, 0.08213417, -0.008961863, -0.040001243, 0.04186625, -0.023078864, -0.038285166, -0.028808976, -0.016579151, 0.011457963, 0.018491607, 0.020625692, 0.0030916813, -0.01212267, -0.035530042, 0.005467065, -0.0062462594, 0.005513851, 0.002216147, -0.017059308, 0.040102564, 0.022302385, 0.014638776, -0.061535556, 0.020904772, 0.03276902, 0.014687002, 0.046775237, -0.0704882, -0.01186539, 0.042448755, -0.02176725, -0.008680935, 0.12509991, 0.05130596, 0.032843765, -0.008563495, -0.028105652, -0.058468718, -0.08164291, 0.0075906436, 0.018401945, 0.067417