Air;\r\n  And oh, the luring thought of it\r\n  Is prayer!\r\n\r\n\r\n_John G. Neihardt_\r\n\r\nFrom", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 291036, "end_char_idx": 291951, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "103a4aac-d2fc-4547-a33d-7e14f7bc499a", "embedding": [0.018524788, -0.019225454, -0.02521216, -0.0025558514, 0.021798018, 0.039298613, 0.0030908685, 0.024365647, -0.012522569, 0.019630307, 0.008424321, 0.012870907, 0.07446944, 0.014253915, 0.063947454, -0.055848602, -0.0072239344, 1.961645e-05, -0.10544475, 0.013068081, 0.023896346, -0.06780727, -0.015250018, -0.021026071, -0.05520643, 0.014403628, 0.023698278, -0.021232884, 0.027958998, -0.00907691, 0.033975344, -0.019859554, 0.026947672, -0.02415841, 0.023380183, 0.019287318, -0.0019576459, 0.013678634, 0.012447595, -0.02454548, -0.06872427, 0.040376414, -0.03910776, -0.0036156634, -0.04386888, -0.0054606115, -0.0125321485, 0.04240582, -0.034015268, 0.06486703, 0.026051397, 0.01444398, -0.05245215, 0.056977917, -0.04758411, -0.019711072, -0.05656477, -0.0005407418, -0.0029534164, 0.003920859, 0.0149169965, 0.034071494, -0.012866803, 0.04683346, -0.015512233, 0.022124609, 0.0046342476, -0.008844568, -0.010981329, 0.04549629, -0.009822922, 0.025114221, -0.046633802, -0.007993219, -0.003149592, -0.019585196, 0.0012713077, 0.019546807, 0.017209796, 0.020458696, -0.043763276, 0.0067987856, 0.07250641, 0.046318892, 0.03395116, -0.004048232, 0.011635999, -0.048447754, -0.05598109, 0.00989349, 0.023795659, 0.074190125, -0.010829527, 0.014817129, 0.084197775, -0.024285067, -0.020739341, -0.06562209, 0.047537066, 0.063447386, 0.051047757, -0.0066190297, -0.0026078783, -0.048772506, -0.042645615, 0.03719731, 0.02947704, -0.042918865, -0.012719684, -0.042378314, -0.0007986522, -0.051975828, 0.002645168, -0.0045019966, 0.023922412, -0.036324922, 0.031704016, 0.005814816, -0