e room!\r\n  Menace me not with your eyes of gloom;\r\n  Jostle me not from the place I seek,\r\n  For my arms are strong and your own are weak,\r\n  And", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 292757, "end_char_idx": 293741, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "16071b56-b1a2-4eee-ab46-46fb10507345", "embedding": [-0.006837454, 0.03755789, -0.061545435, -0.00607994, 0.046121743, 0.012282607, 0.015153085, 0.033309918, -0.0039546895, 0.06443617, -0.012826301, 0.02739106, 0.07867032, 0.020868339, 0.01102286, -0.056832682, 0.007584212, 0.009631352, -0.07883506, 0.02462295, 0.005418906, -0.015965773, 0.010766821, -0.020505186, -0.010114927, -0.01130902, 0.066363946, 0.009158336, -0.0334243, 0.020614741, 0.0087441, -0.004615575, 0.055109084, -0.03538789, 0.03915789, 0.022538893, -0.024402637, 0.045317885, -0.015762476, -0.006613127, -0.112002335, 0.02420882, 0.01658871, 0.053631682, -0.010881598, -0.033085767, 0.03221132, -0.013497114, -0.03385236, 0.017097782, 0.035505902, -0.031912833, -0.062287647, 0.022563357, 0.001797129, -0.007917009, -0.0358378, -0.011586883, 0.044322483, 0.0014416254, 0.010502036, 0.028039213, -0.06864151, -0.008955317, 0.02981449, -0.018214827, -0.016025541, -0.0032640598, -0.03833931, 0.06666452, 0.006332351, 0.022019213, -0.053242497, 0.022445315, 0.034324117, 9.96409e-05, 0.043227457, -0.03597066, -0.0057127243, 0.045703325, -0.022775775, -0.021285301, 0.07393618, 0.026552795, -0.0021198662, 0.012023919, 0.0029984685, -0.02981836, -0.029828643, 0.0016416429, 0.035450213, 0.032473017, -0.021081379, 0.06548593, 0.06990812, -0.030848615, -0.078268364, -0.061929494, 0.043135878, 0.060665745, -0.030565709, 0.010326511, 0.012191465, -0.04506859, -0.02636329, 0.031022646, -0.042806074, -0.0071580457, -0.050655957, -0.020785596, -0.011325441, -0.079589784, 0.0066140313, 0.011915234, 0.026461283, 0.02747