,\r\neven the disagreeable, may be of real help to us. It's good for a dog,\r\nsays a shrewd philosopher, to be pestered with fleas; it keeps him from\r\nthinking too much about being a dog.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 297987, "end_char_idx": 298933, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "4f752640-ff64-4eca-a150-378e063c06f1", "embedding": [-0.011173815, 0.0037375782, 0.01388971, 0.008313336, -0.041647285, 0.03130777, 0.009226397, 0.057840075, 0.0039850003, 0.0482938, -0.03528988, -0.020947874, 0.0795323, 0.014248162, 0.07962187, -0.05811501, -0.03905349, -0.0032913962, -0.050979335, 0.0031355135, 0.024172854, -0.007613976, 0.015661083, -0.013690913, -0.043311786, -0.008114305, 0.02344081, -0.025126318, -0.011391726, -0.030046891, 0.057277188, 0.042644683, 0.011780113, -0.010351827, 0.02809118, 0.031030362, -0.015341635, -0.0041987957, 0.042406775, -0.040108413, -0.083486184, 0.023184007, -0.016818866, 0.035876326, -0.008273935, -0.045179963, -0.037385374, 0.0042057172, -0.020352243, 0.054981735, 0.046737157, -0.01591493, -0.045837577, 0.058651064, -0.0121967625, -0.018269412, -0.0043589654, 0.002252945, 0.04217207, -0.010621775, 0.028849263, -0.003634289, -0.0026850523, -0.008411663, -0.058560237, -0.0046921615, -0.029698413, 0.040494543, -0.021354975, 0.04706079, -0.020215616, 0.054887004, -0.03410243, 0.032246117, -0.0075629377, -0.011414401, -0.039669957, -0.01328363, -0.011291566, 0.04958647, -0.025696672, -0.033367667, 0.09859693, 0.076610915, 0.010424211, 0.0135948695, -0.04680682, -0.027428864, -0.06548021, -0.004863363, 0.00071653083, 0.06590881, -0.0059388033, 0.046103157, 0.08932791, 0.0008496918, -0.069117606, -0.074620664, 0.013092943, 0.07720097, 0.018208198, -0.030543191, 0.0039383774, -0.05076403, 0.04527529, 0.069298096, -0.028961914, -0.0018672699, -0.052590072, -0.068200134, 0.016060866, -