9b6b3", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "2e6c1f92-228e-4c2b-8563-c1699ab6b520", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "08e4b17fa50325e6361cb9dd25eb55ebb643277a7684118537a8ca6b7f7212ca", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "text": "it keeps him from\r\nthinking too much about being a dog.\r\n\r\n\r\n  What's life? A story or a song;\r\n    A race on any track;\r\n  A gay adventure, short or long,\r\n    A puzzling nut to crack;\r\n  A grinding task; a pleasant stroll;\r\n    A climb; a slide down hill;\r\n  A constant striving for a goal;\r\n    A cake; a bitter pill;\r\n  A pit where fortune flouts or stings;\r\n    A playground full of fun;--\r\n  With many any of these things;\r\n    With others all in one.\r\n  What's life? To love the things we see;\r\n    The hills that touch the skies;\r\n  The smiling sea; the laughing lea;\r\n    The light in woman's eyes;\r\n  To work and love the work we do;\r\n    To play a game that's square;\r\n  To grin a bit when feeling blue;\r\n    With friends our joys to share;\r\n  To smile, though games be lost or won;\r\n    To earn our daily bread;--\r\n  And when at last the day is done", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 298878, "end_char_idx": 299739, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "2e6c1f92-228e-4c2b-8563-c1699ab6b520", "embedding": [-0.024453772, 0.061456397, 0.014807687, 0.030703695, -0.03155512, 0.04641395, 0.028783008, 0.03349358, -0.016189922, 0.0064432966, -0.0070443316, 0.02254947, 0.06308637, 0.018355327, 0.05622192, -0.026304232, -0.009984025, -0.005009282, -0.05988531, 0.0156111, -0.017112652, 0.0018778378, -0.0048938747, -0.039920617, -0.049872175, -0.043332003, 0.00018369667, -0.01954469, -0.034001194, -0.03924338, -0.006799053, 0.06959014, 0.05464756, -0.03822576, 0.009282973, 0.028390931, -0.101174325, -0.013551807, 0.011382771, -