lves; for if our virtues\r\n  Did not go forth of us, 'twere all alike\r\n  As if we had them not.\r\n\r\n\r\n_William Shakespeare._\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYOU MAY COUNT THAT DAY\r\n\r\n\r\nA class of little settlement girls besought Mrs. George Herbert Palmer,\r\none insufferable summer morning, to tell them how to be happy. \"I'll\r\ngive you three rules,\" she said, \"and you must keep them every day for a\r\nweek. First, commit something good to memory each day. Three or four\r\nwords will do, just a pretty bit of poem, or a", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 316967, "end_char_idx": 317951, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "8475f254-fb95-4ac2-b1ae-e1e77ce9f93c", "embedding": [0.044574928, 0.033525757, 0.014697007, 0.010944505, -0.054391004, 0.024269447, -0.02270527, 0.055647507, 0.014642336, 0.025708536, 0.008587582, 0.049371835, 0.0794184, 0.021734944, 0.00018395143, -0.04212106, 0.013455447, 0.032836422, -0.07447899, 0.04275861, 0.030985903, -0.0022947278, -0.016398888, -0.06634904, -0.04607417, -0.019130908, 0.05218199, -0.015464061, 0.02303851, -0.038040545, 0.058745183, 0.06051338, 0.04272776, -0.040893607, 0.072297096, 0.01694176, -0.022237575, -0.031761985, 0.020316815, -0.031877, -0.085267596, 0.0055420813, 0.05925638, 0.03161895, -0.08284889, -0.012402726, -0.0440659, 0.019478865, -0.0073543834, 0.050510485, 0.058887426, 0.025251271, 0.015551563, 0.015387891, -0.041500147, -0.069393046, -0.012564413, 0.008728288, 0.042615067, 0.010824192, -0.021733578, 0.032631937, -0.013809282, -0.030694745, -0.023580661, -0.049169146, -0.007350213, -0.013897415, -0.019910894, 0.078687996, 0.025337081, 0.08015159, -0.045509413, 0.049032368, 0.010505002, 0.023783343, 0.02167587, -0.02190569, 0.018317444, 0.037208192, -0.035071846, 0.03132702, 0.097057246, 0.066855446, 0.031752087, 0.017196678, -0.00457464, -0.07408408