ailure. Yet the address was a masterpiece of commemorative\r\noratory.\r\n\r\n\r\n  We cannot kindle when we will\r\n    The fire which in the heart resides;\r\n  The spirit bloweth and is still,\r\n  In mystery our soul abides.\r\n    But", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 323725, "end_char_idx": 324682, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "897ccb22-c948-4998-9740-f4331aee0d32", "embedding": [0.0032641385, 0.020878067, -0.0077759237, 0.04811363, -0.0037952038, 0.05292366, -0.013703231, 0.0152747715, 0.018204268, 0.010054101, -0.010248746, 0.0005918691, 0.087983645, 0.031024005, 0.012181433, -0.029648941, -3.8515238e-05, -0.024717461, -0.059687708, 0.012392251, 0.010107027, -0.022217974, -0.00046496195, -0.050650913, -0.047257233, -0.014457756, 0.031538792, 0.024365269, 0.06743061, 0.010971532, 0.040999845, 0.036530502, 0.033992562, -0.022102183, 0.058508992, 0.013425685, -0.025610236, 0.05186362, 0.013493347, -0.023865469, -0.09677233, 0.058243066, -0.0016539268, 0.045224715, -0.051206715, -0.01798629, -0.026644716, -0.011305265, -0.0137430895, 0.050573885, 0.023652345, 0.017298566, -0.010932102, 0.019878956, -0.05394866, -0.038174532, 0.0050152102, -0.021012163, 0.03377483, 0.018721348, 0.02323263, -0.0037192157, -0.020964203, -0.020617206, 0.008426335, -0.01491815, -0.0010669555, -0.0059228363, 0.008174577, 0.030292138, 0.027624149, -0.017899739, -0.06555096, 0.024903879, 0.040492706, 0.00046195622, -0.00089948374, -0.019715672, 0.0011557633, -0.0068681194, -0.020404518, 0.014196165, 0.065117, 0.071647376, 0.042594265, -0.023884451, -0.034177087, -0.028484609, -0.082036495, 0.0018196921, 0.013686455, 0.03562213, -0.027911747, 0.028523555, 0.07737309, -0.030966477, -0.05731005, -0.03010396, 0.03939752, 0.050405964, 0.03386451, -0.013513261, 0.02385217, -0.098199576, 0.02781257, 0.018007256, -0.048050784, -0.032