\r\n  Be not the thrush that o'er the empty nest\r\n    Is vigil keeping.\r\n\r\n  But in new efforts our regrets to-day\r\n    To stillness whiling,\r\n  Let us in some pure purpose find the way\r\n    To future smiling.\r\n\r\n\r\n_James W. Foley._\r\n\r\nFrom \"The Voices of Song.\"\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nKEEP A-GOIN'!\r\n\r\n\r\nSome men fail and", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 332374, "end_char_idx": 333260, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_seperator": "\n", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, {"__data__": {"id_": "6b9525e9-9a8a-40f5-b460-5b7ef2980cc7", "embedding": [0.0070494995, 0.02045991, -0.0006394501, 0.035925355, 0.02152772, 0.041876014, 0.017034428, 0.021732878, 0.018206233, 0.033827506, -0.007963318, 0.056299135, 0.07759211, 0.03221092, 0.04160653, -0.07345243, 0.009786707, -0.012254392, -0.07030681, 0.02567078, 0.01256943, -0.017360628, -0.0028188566, -0.043107167, -0.015600027, -0.008639794, 0.07380892, -0.053046305, -0.009598021, -0.013915278, 0.04250176, 0.025600662, 0.033629593, -0.012493299, 0.011315154, 0.037933722, -0.025642928, 0.039612535, -0.015496493, -0.04439863, -0.09410615, 0.06493356, -0.046308182, 0.05052202, 0.0053979554, -0.038800668, -0.022140801, 0.016390288, -0.04185352, 0.04992537, 0.009711299, 0.0040611243, -0.002730717, 0.023199515, 0.021902865, -0.02472078, 0.003306721, -0.046666835, 0.0054386253, -0.007276078, 0.04769794, 0.019077713, 0.0038876298, 0.0059917094, -0.018808253, -0.0072439937, -0.0441614, -0.006319962, -0.0049063573, 0.0035091233, -0.007894503, 0.012247034, -0.05030872, 0.05726281, 0.045686528, -0.008665731, 0.03885155, -0.08949099, 0.0151001, 0.04446366, -0.030970473, -0.0013715929, 0.064476766, 0.11991069, 0.011584223, 0.0096504325, -0.0107829645, -0.030319814, -0.046339445, -0.019771134, 0.02560798, 0.037445333, -0.057588972, 0.01731512, 0.1005035, -0.040605515, -0.07401842, -0.05258453, 0.012851096, 0.0268974, 0.03437929, -0.0